(19,14,'知其安装在某一车辆上。Theterminalsendsamessagetothe\nplatformthatitisinstalledonacertainvehicle.\n2.1.3注销deregister\n终端向平台发送消息告知从所安装车辆拆下。Theterminalsendsamessagetothe\nplatformthatitisremovedfromthevehicle.\n\n2\n2.1.4鉴权authentication\n终端连接上平台时向平台发送消息,以使平台验证自己身份。\nWhentheterminalisconnectedtotheplatform,itsendsamessagetothe\nplatform,sothattheplatformcanverifytheidentity.\n2.1.5位置汇报策略 locationreportingstrategy\n定时、定距汇报或两者结合。Timed,distancedreportingoracombinationofboth.\n2.1.6位置汇报方案 locationreportingprogram\n根据相关条件确定周期汇报的间隔的规则。Rulesfordeterminingtheintervalfor\nperiodicreportingbasedonrelevantconditions.\n2.1.7拐点补传 additionalpointsreportwhileturning\n终端在判断到车辆拐弯时发送位置信息汇报消息。\nTheterminalsendsapositioninformationreportmessagewhenjudgingthatthe\nvehicleturns.\n2.2缩略语abbreviation\n下列缩略语适用于本文件Thefollowingabbreviationsapplytothisdocument\nAPN 接入点名称(AccessPointName)\nSMS 短消息服务(ShortMessageService)\nTCP 传输控制协议(TransmissionControlProtocol)\nTTS 文本到语音(TextToSpeech)\nUDP 用户数据报协议(UserDatagramProtocol)\nVSS 车辆速度传感器(VehicleSpeedSensor)\n3协议基础ProtocolBasics\n3.1通信方式wayofcommunication\n通信协议采用TCP，平台作为服务器端，终端作为客户端。\nThiscommunicationprotocoladoptsTCP,theplatformactsastheserverside,andtheterminal\nactsastheclientside.\n3.2数据类型DataTypes\n协议消息中使用的数据类型见表1：\nThedatatypesusedintheprotocolmessagesareshowninTable1:\n表1Table1 数据类型DataTypes\n数据类型\nDataTypes\n描述及要求DESCRIPTION&REQUIREMENTS\nBYTE 无符号单字节整型（字节，8位）unsigned\nsingle-byteinteger(byte,8bits)\n\n3\nWORD 无符号双字节整型（字，16位）unsigned\ndouble-byteinteger(word,16bits)\nD','[-0.006322293,-0.006038223,0.016212784,-0.01143902,-0.028407015,0.0070324684,-0.02074405,-0.005296869,0.005684867,-0.024665603,0.008113321,0.032730423,-0.026314596,0.008480533,-0.005591332,0.0022413828,0.020148195,0.0063811857,0.032342426,0.017473778,0.016337497,0.00992167,-0.027076736,0.012485229,-0.010912451,0.031400144,0.039270967,-0.015339788,-0.00992167,0.0060209013,0.0036374836,0.002269097,-0.03622241,-0.010621452,0.008300391,-0.00019767991,-0.013739295,-0.029598724,0.01056602