(20,14,'RD 无符号四字节整型（双字，32位）Unsigned\nfour-byteinteger(doubleword,32bits)\nBYTE[n]n字节Nbyte\nBCD[n]8421码，n字节8421code，nbyte\nSTRINGGBK编码，若无数据，置空GBKencoding,empty\nifthereisnodata\n3.3传输规则TransmissionRules\n协议采用大端模式（big-endian）的网络字节序来传递字和双字。\nTheprotocolusesbig-endiannetworkbyteordertopasswordsanddoublewords.\n约定如下：Theagreementisasfollows:\n----------字节（BYTE）的传输约定：按照字节流的方式传输；\n----------Byte(BYTE)transmissionconvention:accordingtothewayofbytestreamtransmission;\n----------字（WORD）的传输约定：先传递高八位，再传递低八位；\n----------Word(WORD)transmissionconvention:firsttransmittheuppereightbits,andthen\ntransmitthelowereightbits\n----------双字节（DWORD）的传输约定：先传递高24位，然后传递高16位，在传递高八\n位，最后传递低八位。\n----------Double-byte(DWORD)transmissionconvention:firsttransmitthehigh24bits,then\ntransmitthehigh16bits,thentransmitthehigheightbits,andfinallytransmittheloweightbits.\n3.4消息的组成compositionofthemessage\n3.4.1消息结构messagestructure\n每条消息由标位头、消息头、消息体和校验码组成，消息结构如图1所示Eachmessageconsists\nofaheader,amessageheader,amessagebodyandacheckcode.Themessagestructureisshownin\nFigure1:\n标识位\nidentificationbit\n消息头messageheader 消息体messagebody 检验码checkcode 标识位\nidentificationbit\n图1消息结构图Figure1Messagestructurediagram\n3.4.2标识位identificationbit\n采用0x7e表示，若校验码、消息头以及消息体中出现0x7e，则要进行转义处理，转义规则定义\n如下Itisrepresentedby0x7e.If0x7eappearsinthecheckcode,messageheaderandmessagebody,it\nmustbetransferredmeaning.Thetransferredmeaningrulesaredefinedasfollows:\n\n4\n0x7e←→0x7d后紧跟一个0x02； 0x7e←→0x7dfollowedbya0x02;\n0x7d←→0x7d后紧跟一个0x01 0x7d←→0x7dfollowedby','[-0.008788793,0.008263377,-0.004452397,-0.0070419526,0.00090753846,-0.0043125134,-0.0012691891,-0.0070078345,-0.017263701,-0.0277311,-0.0027874396,0.023937179,-0.02276352,-0.005506643,-0.020416204,0.02086656,-0.006475594,-0.0016734872,0.04694635,0.019147014,0.022313163,0.016554046,-0.027116977,-0.007130659,-0.009628096,0.0057181744,0.029396057,-0.011695646,0.008897971,-0.020962091,0.017263701,0.005240523,-0.014602498,-0.011873059,0.014370496,0.022449635,-0.0055646435,0.0015003384,0.0117