(24,14,'mforauthenticationafterthe\nconnectionisestablished.\n4.2连接的维持connectionmaintenance\n连接建立和终端鉴权成功后，终端应周期性地向平台发送终端心跳消息，平台收到后向终\n端发送平台通用应答消息，发送周期由终端参数指定。\nAftertheconnectionisestablishedandtheterminalauthenticationissuccessful,theterminal\nshouldperiodicallysendaterminalheartbeatmessagetotheplatform.Aftertheplatformreceivesit,it\nwillsendaplatformgeneralresponsemessagetotheterminal.Thesendingperiodisspecifiedbythe\nterminalparameters.\n4.3连接的断开Disconnection\n平台和终端均可根据TCP协议主动断开连接，双方都应主动判断TCP连接是否断开。\nBoththeplatformandtheterminalcanactivelydisconnectaccordingtotheTCPprotocol,and\nbothpartiesshouldactivelydeterminewhethertheTCPconnectionisdisconnected.\n平台判断TCP连接断开的方法：\nTheplatformdeterminesthemethodofTCPconnectiondisconnection:\n————根据TCP协议判断出终端主动断开；\n————AccordingtotheTCPprotocol,itisjudgedthattheterminalisactivelydisconnected;\n————相同身份的终端建立新连接，表明原连接已断开；\n————Theterminalwiththesameidentityestablishesanewconnection,indicatingthattheoriginal\nconnectionhasbeendisconnected;\n————在一定的时间内未收到终端发出的消息，如终端心跳。\n\n7\n————Themessagefromtheterminalisnotreceivedwithinacertainperiodoftime,suchasthe\nheartbeatoftheterminal,\n终端判断TCP连接断开的方法：\nThemethodfortheterminaltojudgethedisconnectionoftheTCPconnection:\n————根据TCP协议判断出平台主动断开；\n————AccordingtotheTCPprotocol,itisjudgedthattheplatformisactivelydisconnected;\n————数据通信链路断开；\n————thedatacommunicationlinkisdisconnected;\n————数据通信链路正常，达到重传次数后仍未收到应答。\n————Thedatacommunicationlinkisnormal,andnoresponseisreceivedafte','[-0.024148962,0.009878511,0.015271062,-0.0073534795,-0.022214895,0.0071654455,-0.018951159,0.0015361721,-0.0005960012,-0.009032357,-0.0038144079,0.05012454,-0.027211232,0.0050030523,0.00071646064,-0.020710623,0.029225884,0.006604701,0.020871794,0.0019491758,0.016855922,0.019783882,-0.042468864,-0.0037673991,-0.01418315,0.016627595,0.022564102,-0.017527472,-0.015606837,0.00068624085,0.00038907965,0.004193834,-0.029145299,-0.0031697191,-0.002135531,0.012887057,-0.0042542736,-0.023759462,-0.00068078446,-0.01606349,0.021503