(23,NULL,NULL,3,34,'upload/audio/YZ1z-halil-berkan-audio.mp3','{\"task\":\"transcribe\",\"language\":\"english\",\"duration\":138.94000244140625,\"segments\":[{\"id\":0,\"seek\":0,\"start\":0,\"end\":5,\"text\":\" A believer is a person who is far from making claims.\",\"tokens\":[50364,316,23892,307,257,954,567,307,1400,490,1455,9441,13,50614],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":1,\"seek\":0,\"start\":5,\"end\":8,\"text\":\" Faith should keep a person away from making claims.\",\"tokens\":[50614,23642,820,1066,257,954,1314,490,1455,9441,13,50764],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":2,\"seek\":0,\"start\":8,\"end\":12,\"text\":\" A claimant who claims impossible things cannot be a true believer.\",\"tokens\":[50764,316,3932,394,567,9441,6243,721,2644,312,257,2074,23892,13,50964],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":3,\"seek\":0,\"start\":12,\"end\":16,\"text\":\" If we do everything within the circle of complete sincerity\",\"tokens\":[50964,759,321,360,1203,1951,264,6329,295,3566,44040,51164],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":4,\"seek\":0,\"start\":16,\"end\":18,\"text\":\" with the goal of seeking the pleasure of Allah\",\"tokens\":[51164,365,264,3387,295,11670,264,6834,295,4574,51264],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":5,\"seek\":0,\"start\":18,\"end\":22,\"text\":\" and ultimately turning to Him with love and enthusiasm,\",\"tokens\":[51264,293,6284,6246,281,5920,365,959,293,23417,11,51464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":6,\"seek\":0,\"start\":22,\"end\":25,\"text\":\" then our actions have meaning.\",\"tokens\":[51464,550,527,5909,362,3620,13,51614],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":7,\"seek\":0,\"start\":25,\"end\":29,\"text\":\" Otherwise, even if we perform great actions,\",\"tokens\":[51614,10328,11,754,498,321,2042,869,5909,11,51814],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.21053479611873627,\"compression_ratio\":1.719665288925171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.29462191462516785,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":8,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":29,\"end\":32,\"text\":\" if they are devoid of these considerations,\",\"tokens\":[50364,498,436,366,1905,17079,295,613,24070,11,50514],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":9,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":32,\"end\":35,\"text\":\" we would have been pounding on the straw in vain.\",\"tokens\":[50514,321,576,362,668,40034,322,264,10099,294,22240,13,50664],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":10,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":35,\"end\":39,\"text\":\" We would have been pounding on chaff without any grain.\",\"tokens\":[50664,492,576,362,668,40034,322,417,2518,1553,604,12837,13,50864],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":11,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":39,\"end\":43,\"text\":\" Two wings that prevent a person from falling into the lowest depths\",\"tokens\":[50864,4453,11405,300,4871,257,954,490,7440,666,264,12437,28439,51064],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":12,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":43,\"end\":47,\"text\":\" are sincere belief in Allah and righteous deeds.\",\"tokens\":[51064,366,16941,7107,294,4574,293,16153,24539,13,51264],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":13,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":47,\"end\":51,\"text\":\" In matters of faith, knowledge, love and enthusiasm,\",\"tokens\":[51264,682,7001,295,4522,11,3601,11,959,293,23417,11,51464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":14,\"seek\":2900,\"start\":51,\"end\":54,\"text\":\" a person should never be satisfied but always ask,\",\"tokens\":[51464,257,954,820,1128,312,11239,457,1009,1029,11,51614],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16923250257968903,\"compression_ratio\":1.6371681690216064,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10627193748950958,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":15,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":54,\"end\":56,\"text\":\" Is there nothing more?\",\"tokens\":[50364,1119,456,1825,544,30,50464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":16,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":56,\"end\":60,\"text\":\" Because the journey on the path of limitless perfection is itself limitless,\",\"tokens\":[50464,1436,264,4671,322,264,3100,295,4948,1832,19708,307,2564,4948,1832,11,50664],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":17,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":60,\"end\":62,\"text\":\" it never ends.\",\"tokens\":[50664,309,1128,5314,13,50764],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":18,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":62,\"end\":65,\"text\":\" The branches of fruitful trees hang low.\",\"tokens\":[50764,440,14770,295,49795,5852,3967,2295,13,50914],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":19,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":65,\"end\":68,\"text\":\" As a person progresses and elevates,\",\"tokens\":[50914,1018,257,954,41929,293,7701,1024,11,51064],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":20,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":68,\"end\":71,\"text\":\" they should become even more humble and self-effacing.\",\"tokens\":[51064,436,820,1813,754,544,16735,293,2698,12,30774,5615,13,51214],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":21,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":71,\"end\":75,\"text\":\" The branches of trees laden with fruits hang down.\",\"tokens\":[51214,440,14770,295,5852,6632,268,365,12148,3967,760,13,51414],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":22,\"seek\":5400,\"start\":75,\"end\":79,\"text\":\" It is the pine trees, poplars, the trees that do not bear fruit,\",\"tokens\":[51414,467,307,264,15113,5852,11,1665,75,685,11,264,5852,300,360,406,6155,6773,11,51614],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.17005597054958344,\"compression_ratio\":1.6351351737976074,\"no_speech_prob\":0.770879864692688,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":23,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":79,\"end\":85,\"text\":\" that always stand upright and express themselves.\",\"tokens\":[50364,300,1009,1463,27405,293,5109,2969,13,50664],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":24,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":85,\"end\":90,\"text\":\" The prayer of a believer actually reminds them of such a matter at all times.\",\"tokens\":[50664,440,8767,295,257,23892,767,12025,552,295,1270,257,1871,412,439,1413,13,50914],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":25,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":90,\"end\":93,\"text\":\" In the face of the bounties of Allah,\",\"tokens\":[50914,682,264,1851,295,264,272,792,530,295,4574,11,51064],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":26,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":93,\"end\":98,\"text\":\" it is incumbent upon the servant to bow down and prostrate.\",\"tokens\":[51064,309,307,45539,3564,264,17896,281,4503,760,293,10293,4404,13,51314],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":27,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":98,\"end\":101,\"text\":\" But this should be the case at every stage of life,\",\"tokens\":[51314,583,341,820,312,264,1389,412,633,3233,295,993,11,51464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":28,\"seek\":7900,\"start\":101,\"end\":105,\"text\":\" at the stage of writing, at the typewriter stage,\",\"tokens\":[51464,412,264,3233,295,3579,11,412,264,2010,23681,3233,11,51664],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16792750358581543,\"compression_ratio\":1.6029411554336548,\"no_speech_prob\":0.6211805939674377,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":29,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":105,\"end\":109,\"text\":\" at the master stage, at the doctorate stage,\",\"tokens\":[50364,412,264,4505,3233,11,412,264,4631,473,3233,11,50564],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":30,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":109,\"end\":112,\"text\":\" at the stage of giving sermons and advice,\",\"tokens\":[50564,412,264,3233,295,2902,816,27229,293,5192,11,50714],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":31,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":112,\"end\":114,\"text\":\" at the stage of delivering sermons,\",\"tokens\":[50714,412,264,3233,295,14666,816,27229,11,50814],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":32,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":114,\"end\":116,\"text\":\" at the stage of leading prayers,\",\"tokens\":[50814,412,264,3233,295,5775,16860,11,50914],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":33,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":116,\"end\":120,\"text\":\" in the active service of being a member.\",\"tokens\":[50914,294,264,4967,2643,295,885,257,4006,13,51114],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":34,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":120,\"end\":123,\"text\":\" When you go to a country where Allah has granted you acceptance,\",\"tokens\":[51114,1133,291,352,281,257,1941,689,4574,575,12344,291,20351,11,51264],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":35,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":123,\"end\":127,\"text\":\" and people there open their hearts to you like castle gates,\",\"tokens\":[51264,293,561,456,1269,641,8852,281,291,411,14114,19792,11,51464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":36,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":127,\"end\":131,\"text\":\" welcoming you with love, and you are doing work there.\",\"tokens\":[51464,17378,291,365,959,11,293,291,366,884,589,456,13,51664],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":37,\"seek\":10500,\"start\":131,\"end\":134,\"text\":\" When you go to a country and within a year or two,\",\"tokens\":[51664,1133,291,352,281,257,1941,293,1951,257,1064,420,732,11,51814],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.16345109045505524,\"compression_ratio\":1.923766851425171,\"no_speech_prob\":0.44948363304138184,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":38,\"seek\":13400,\"start\":134,\"end\":136,\"text\":\" you open a hundred schools.\",\"tokens\":[50364,291,1269,257,3262,4656,13,50464],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.18207046389579773,\"compression_ratio\":0.9710144996643066,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10814218968153,\"transient\":false},{\"id\":39,\"seek\":13400,\"start\":136,\"end\":139,\"text\":\" This requires your bending like a cane.\",\"tokens\":[50464,639,7029,428,22487,411,257,27518,13,50614],\"temperature\":0,\"avg_logprob\":-0.18207046389579773,\"compression_ratio\":0.9710144996643066,\"no_speech_prob\":0.10814218968153,\"transient\":false}],\"text\":\"A believer is a person who is far from making claims. Faith should keep a person away from making claims. A claimant who claims impossible things cannot be a true believer. If we do everything within the circle of complete sincerity with the goal of seeking the pleasure of Allah and ultimately turning to Him with love and enthusiasm, then our actions have meaning. Otherwise, even if we perform great actions, if they are devoid of these considerations, we would have been pounding on the straw in vain. We would have been pounding on chaff without any grain. Two wings that prevent a person from falling into the lowest depths are sincere belief in Allah and righteous deeds. In matters of faith, knowledge, love and enthusiasm, a person should never be satisfied but always ask, Is there nothing more? Because the journey on the path of limitless perfection is itself limitless, it never ends. The branches of fruitful trees hang low. As a person progresses and elevates, they should become even more humble and self-effacing. The branches of trees laden with fruits hang down. It is the pine trees, poplars, the trees that do not bear fruit, that always stand upright and express themselves. The prayer of a believer actually reminds them of such a matter at all times. In the face of the bounties of Allah, it is incumbent upon the servant to bow down and prostrate. But this should be the case at every stage of life, at the stage of writing, at the typewriter stage, at the master stage, at the doctorate stage, at the stage of giving sermons and advice, at the stage of delivering sermons, at the stage of leading prayers, in the active service of being a member. When you go to a country where Allah has granted you acceptance, and people there open their hearts to you like castle gates, welcoming you with love, and you are doing work there. When you go to a country and within a year or two, you open a hundred schools. This requires your bending like a cane.\"}','A believer is a person who is far from making claims. Faith should keep a person away from making claims. A claimant who claims impossible things cannot be a true believer. If we do everything within the circle of complete sincerity with the goal of seeking the pleasure of Allah and ultimately turning to Him with love and enthusiasm, then our actions have meaning. Otherwise, even if we perform great actions, if they are devoid of these considerations, we would have been pounding on the straw in vain. We would have been pounding on chaff without any grain. Two wings that prevent a person from falling into the lowest depths are sincere belief in Allah and righteous deeds. In matters of faith, knowledge, love and enthusiasm, a person should never be satisfied but always ask, Is there nothing more? Because the journey on the path of limitless perfection is itself limitless, it never ends. The branches of fruitful trees hang low. As a person progresses and elevates, they should become even more humble and self-effacing. The branches of trees laden with fruits hang down. It is the pine trees, poplars, the trees that do not bear fruit, that always stand upright and express themselves. The prayer of a believer actually reminds them of such a matter at all times. In the face of the bounties of Allah, it is incumbent upon the servant to bow down and prostrate. But this should be the case at every stage of life, at the stage of writing, at the typewriter stage, at the master stage, at the doctorate stage, at the stage of giving sermons and advice, at the stage of delivering sermons, at the stage of leading prayers, in the active service of being a member. When you go to a country where Allah has granted you acceptance, and people there open their hearts to you like castle gates, welcoming you with love, and you are doing work there. When you go to a country and within a year or two, you open a hundred schools. This requires your bending like a cane.','Yot8YFQVaI7zHv0i7BZudoPfMQFR5mHJgaq6H7UNkXO0D5kqehDDmYB8AxM48OxwQwBpT9AK5EWpFoKY49dlX3Ip8yqk0LQ1uVclybUCIx6A4WxpN505zkaxCeGw7tGY5ykuCu1UlmELG11ykpiiFtqy6HqsvV6YKQicXSyW766icyltku5pcdq6a7Jd7Fxn3m1cudGOTDblQ4cH0oJFXsMUJeyUB4yvAL45yALi5lCaM9wnA1Yxn9vXJVRPwLtZ','351','351','2024-03-25 00:17:59','2024-03-25 00:17:59','New Workbook','FY9dbzUhalil-berkan-speech-to-text-w