(52,NULL,NULL,15,40,'Original Content: Request for Work Experience Verification\r\nI am writing to request a formal verification of my work experience at Lego Start Hotel. It’s known that, I have been employed there as a supervisor. This request is for academic purposes, specifically for the Catering and Tourism Training Institute (CTTI).\r\nI would be grateful if you could provide a letter confirming my employment dates, position, and a brief overview of the responsibilities I have undertaken in both capacities (supervisor and front office).\r\nSincerely,\r\nEfrata Birhane.\n\n\nMust Rewrite content with Professional mode differently with original content. Result language is English US \n','Subject: Request for Verification of Work Experience\n\nDear [Recipient\'s Name],\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing to request formal verification of my previous work experience at Lego Start Hotel. As you may recall, I had the privilege of working at the hotel as a supervisor, and I am now seeking this verification for academic purposes, specifically for the Catering and Tourism Training Institute (CTTI).\n\nI would greatly appreciate it if you could provide a letter that confirms my employment dates, details my position as a supervisor, and provides a concise overview of the responsibilities I successfully undertook in both capacities, both as a supervisor and in the front office.\n\nYour support in this matter is crucial to my academic aspirations, and I am genuinely grateful for your assistance.\n\nThank you for your attention to this request, and I look forward to receiving the verification letter at your earliest convenience.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nEfrata Birhane','Subject: Request for Verification of Work Experience<br/><br/>Dear [Recipient\'s Name],<br/><br/>I hope this email finds you well. I am writing to request formal verification of my previous work experience at Lego Start Hotel. As you may recall, I had the privilege of working at the hotel as a supervisor, and I am now seeking this verification for academic purposes, specifically for the Catering and Tourism Training Institute (CTTI).<br/><br/>I would greatly appreciate it if you could provide a letter that confirms my employment dates, details my position as a supervisor, and provides a concise overview of the responsibilities I successfully undertook in both capacities, both as a supervisor and in the front office.<br/><br/>Your support in this matter is crucial to my academic aspirations, and I am genuinely grateful for your assistance.<br/><br/>Thank you for your attention to this request, and I look forward to receiving the verification letter at your earliest convenience.<br/><br/>Warm regards,<br/><br/>Efrata Birhane','2CcItH2tDYyja5Tkmrom61Sk9NSw2KPoZ8fmKpyatWCrhiPnQrsGzzeQSBvun3Uvi5LnTrNSiQFmOg67YStfSMgO0xCgxNyGiGjleYJN4zVlAAIlUAKoTWtMacQd8EuMtIBJS4jhF0xMkzhcDeylSKaCgb2nNOg8kGj3vULCsODG8iQ2mhTw67Oi76KPbfHO57erGBjABmoYReDtB96R2LRviF4iILVd3GgP88UlYso9YXKZne79j47ldLpMSqkP','165','165','2024-06-10 17:32:31','2024-06-10 17:32:34','New Workbook','7ZBTAevgeorge-yehish-workbook',NULL,NULL,NULL,'COMPLETED'),
(53,NULL,NULL,15,40,'Original Content: summarize the following in two paragraph with out omiting the mian skills. \'\'Work Experience\r\nEfrata Birhane\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nHighly motivated and results-oriented hospitality professional with 2 years of experience in the hotel industry. Proven ability to excel in both supervisory and front-office roles, fostering a positive guest experience while maximizing operational efficiency. Skilled in guest service, staff training, problem-solving, and administrative tasks.\r\n\r\nExperience\r\n\r\nLego Start Hotel | Addis Ababa, Ethiopia | [Start Date] - Present\r\n\r\nSupervisor | [Year] - Present\r\n\r\nLed a team of front-office associates, ensuring efficient guest check-in/check-out procedures, reservation management, and accurate billing.\r\nProvided ongoing coaching and development opportunities to enhance team performance and guest satisfaction.\r\nCultivated a positive and productive work environment, fostering strong team collaboration and adherence to company policies.\r\nMonitored key performance indicators (KPIs) and implemented strategies to improve guest satisfaction and operational efficiency.\r\nFront Office Supervisor | [Year]\r\n\r\nOversaw all front-office operations, ensuring seamless guest experiences and adherence to brand standards.\r\nProvided exceptional customer service, resolving guest inquiries and concerns promptly and professionally.\r\nManaged room inventory, room assignments, and housekeeping requests to optimize guest satisfaction and room occupancy.\r\nMaintained accurate and up-to-date guest registration records, financial transactions, and reports.\r\nSkills\r\n\r\nGuest Service | Front Office Operations | Team Leadership | Staff Training | Problem-Solving | Communication | Time Management | Organization | Administrative Skills\r\nSoftware Proficiency\r\n\r\nProperty Management Systems (PMS) | Reservation Systems | Microsoft Office Suite.\'\'.\n\n\nMust Rewrite content with Professional mode differently with original content. Result language is English US \n','Efrata Birhane is a highly motivated and results-oriented hospitality professional with 2 years of experience in the hotel industry. Throughout her career, she has excelled in both supervisory and front-office roles, ensuring a positive guest experience while maximizing operational efficiency. Efrata possesses a wide range of skills including guest service, staff training, problem-solving, and administrative tasks.\n\nCurrently working at Lego Start Hotel in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia, Efrata serves as a Supervisor, leading a team of front-office associates. She is responsible for ensuring efficient guest check-in/check-out procedures, reservation management, and accurate billing. Efrata also provides ongoing coaching and development opportunities to enhance team performance and guest satisfaction. Moreover, she cultivates a positive and productive work environment, fostering strong team collaboration and adherence to company policies. With a keen eye on key performance indicators (KPIs), Efrata implements strategies to improve guest satisfaction and operational efficiency.\n\nIn previous roles as a Front Office Supervisor, Efrata successfully oversaw all front-office operations, ensuring seamless guest experiences while adhering to brand standards. She consistently delivered exceptional customer service, promptly and professionally addressing guest inquiries and concerns. Additionally, Efrata managed room inventory, room assignments, and housekeeping requests to optimize guest satisfaction and room occupancy. She also maintained accurate and up-to-date guest registration records, financial transactions, and reports.\n\nEfrata possesses a range of skills including guest service, front office operations, team leadership, staff training, problem-solving, communication, time management, organization, and administrative tasks. She is also proficient in various software, including property management systems (PMS), reservation systems, and the Microsoft Office Suite. Through her dedication and expertise, she consistently excels in her role, making a positive impact in the hospitality industry.','Efrata Birhane is a highly motivated and results-oriented hospitality professional with 2 years of experience in the hotel industry. Throughout her career, she has excelled in both supervisory and front-office roles, ensuring a positive guest experience while maximizing operational efficiency. Efrata possesses a wide range of skills including guest service, staff training, problem-solving, and administrative tasks.<br/><br/>Currently working at Lego Start Hotel in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia, Efrata serves as a Supervisor, leading a team of front-office associates. She is responsible for ensuring efficient guest check-in/check-out procedures, reservation management, and accurate billing. Efrata also provides ongoing coaching and development opportunities to enhance team performance and guest satisfaction. Moreover, she cultivates a positive and productive work environment, fostering strong team collaboration and adherence to company policies. With a keen eye on key performance indicators (KPIs), Efrata implements strategies to improve guest satisfaction and operational efficiency.<br/><br/>In previous roles as a Front Office Supervisor, Efrata successfully oversaw all front-office operations, ensuring seamless guest experiences while adhering to brand standards. She consistently delivered exceptional customer service, promptly and professionally addressing guest inquiries and concerns. Additionally, Efrata managed room inventory, room assignments, and housekeeping requests to optimize guest satisfaction and room occupancy. She also maintained accurate and up-to-date guest registration records, financial transactions, and reports.<br/><br/>Efrata possesses a range of skills including guest service, front office operations, team leadership, staff training, problem-solving, communication, time management, organization, and administrative tasks. She is also proficient in various software, including property management systems (PMS), reservation systems, and the Microsoft Office Suite. Through her dedication and expertise, she consistently excels in her role, making a positive impact in the hospitality industry.','1oMWhcXkJkRh1bkJSXbFsowbq3jt9fWVQssg4Bbg8kJAjLlbOVVNryAFhhxveJ48glwS58xHbdR2yiaYgc3q1X6zuitick3WqINIH0O2HYpB5vhkHlBaMhfucZLB6iQBoVLcl6FrWBStoZF9rXZOfadSlnkQ0O0fV3jEFRJpoyPjcqgpObRXCP0PMCQij1q3fLcPqfR3ajL9hIROHfLFpdNJGI9tpOhtKa2meARj6pUVG2kY9Ir1Yv1BGKinNY73','312','312','2024-06-10 17:48:11','2024-06-10 17:48:17','New Workbook','2bMQCdKgeorge-yehish-workbook',NULL,NULL,NULL,'COMPLETED'),
