(111,59,2,'What is the web app?','The web app being referred to is OminiAI, an all-in-one platform designed to generate AI content. It offers a range of features, including an AI generator for text, images, code, chatbots, and more. The app also provides an advanced dashboard for user insights and analytics, secure payment processing, multilingual capabilities, and support ticket management. It aims to unleash the power of AI to help users generate high-quality content quickly and efficiently.','The web app being referred to is OminiAI, an all-in-one platform designed to generate AI content. It offers a range of features, including an AI generator for text, images, code, chatbots, and more. The app also provides an advanced dashboard for user insights and analytics, secure payment processing, multilingual capabilities, and support ticket management. It aims to unleash the power of AI to help users generate high-quality content quickly and efficiently.','GAjTqs5UOSWJPQkFaEQype4WWPOiaVEXR4wpXoK1uXmrspC8AYCuqQvN64WBJkv1M5XZMB16aKKrKA0Rm2OaxDKG20YYoZVwFb2tTrrco7GJOyMIKrUSiKY6I5gvGqrvzMYgtyPkEpfkrmRpzIJKOAW13N5Ozc2KjmwlQg77Bwg6LgiAgBMlYLYAoGoFtr5jNAZwgwL8BfJZNR8lkZ05vyl5pua0ijvxY5s1wOKT2t75JPCZWATf8Gfl9meG7obE','78','78','2024-12-19 12:22:31','2024-12-19 12:22:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0),
